graph LR
    NG["NeMo-Guardrails Server"]

    %% Runtime libraries
    NG -->|HTTP server| FastAPI["FastAPI / uvicorn / starlette"]
    NG -->|LLM client| OpenAISDK["openai 2.45.0 / langchain-openai"]
    NG -->|local classifiers| Torch["torch 2.11.0 pinned<br/>diverges from base torch 2.13"]
    NG -->|embeddings| Embed["transformers / sentence-transformers<br/>fastembed / onnxruntime"]
    NG -->|PII detection| Presidio["presidio + spaCy + nltk"]
    NG -->|injection rules| Yara["yara-python"]
    NG -.->|optional tracing| OTelLib["opentelemetry-* 1.43.0"]

    %% Internal RHOAI
    TrustyAI["TrustyAI Service Operator"] -->|deploys image via CR| NG
    NG -->|REST OpenAI-compatible| KServe["KServe / vLLM"]
    LlamaStack["Llama Stack / Client Apps"] -->|REST 8000/TCP| NG

    %% Build-time
    AIPCC["AIPCC base image<br/>cpu-torch2.13-el9.8"] -.->|base image| NG
    Modelcars["RHAI modelcar images 3.0<br/>MiniLM, Arctic, spaCy, punkt,<br/>Wolf Defender, Granite Guardian HAP"] -.->|baked models| NG
    PyIndex["RHAI PyPI index<br/>rhoai/3.5/cpu-ubi9 (legacy channel)"] -.->|requirements.txt| NG

    %% External services
    NG -.->|optional HTTPS/443| OpenAI["OpenAI / Azure OpenAI"]
    NG -.->|optional HTTPS/443| SaaS["f5 / polygraf / guardrails_ai"]
    NG -.->|optional OTLP| Collector["OTLP Collector"]
    NG -.-x|disabled DO_NOT_TRACK| NVTel["NVIDIA telemetry"]

